# Ignore everything by default; this repo is a shared allowlist, not a
# personal dump. Only shared-notes/, shared-ideas/, templates/, .claude/
# skills, and the README are checked in.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!shared-notes/
!shared-notes/**
!templates/
!templates/**
!.claude/
!.claude/**
!shared-ideas/
!shared-ideas/**
